<title>UK: GUS up on follow through buying.</title>
<headline>GUS up on follow through buying.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Great Universal Stores continued to rise on follow through buying from yesterday, when brokerage ABN AMRO Hoare Govett issued a buy note on the stock, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0753 GMT, the shares were up 13p to 648-1/2p, after climbing 10-1/2p yesterday.</p>
<p>The brokerage firm valued the shares as high as 770p.</p>
<p>-- Debra Sherman, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
</text>
